Placeholder for cross-cutting libraries shared across services:
  - common-domain/        (DTOs, Kafka event contracts)
  - common-security/      (OAuth2 Resource Server config, token relay helpers)
  - common-observability/ (Micrometer + OpenTelemetry instrumentation)

Added as services grow and we need to deduplicate cross-cutting concerns.
Each library here is a regular jar that services depend on.
